# Mem0 scope (this project)

When using mem0 MCP tools (`add_memory`, `search_memories`, `get_memories`, `update_memory`, `delete_memory`, etc.):

- Always set `user_id: "ibov_finance"` on writes
- Always set `app_id: "ibov_finance"` on writes
- Always filter reads with `{"AND": [{"user_id": "ibov_finance"}, {"app_id": "ibov_finance"}]}`
- Never use the default `mem0-mcp` scope for this project
